	quest.550AE537ED3CD72E.quest_desc: [
		"Ever wanted to make your own personal keycard for secure access? Now you can."
		""
		"&6独特卡牌：&r使用卡牌刻印器制作。由于注册了玩家名称，所以无法伪造。"
		""
